      "message": "contrib: require trusted signers in verify.py\n\nverify_shasums_signature previously added len(good_untrusted) into\nnum_trusted, allowing valid signatures from untrusted keys in the local\nkeyring to satisfy --min-good-sigs even when --trusted-keys did not\nmatch any signer.\n\nCount only distinct non-revoked trusted signers toward the threshold,\nmatch --trusted-keys against full fingerprints from GNUPG VALIDSIG\nstatus lines while deduplicating by primary key fingerprint, and add\nunit tests in contrib/verify-binaries/test.py.",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Enes Subas",
        "email": "19182329+enessubass@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-11-24T13:56:54Z"
      },
      "author": {
        "name": "Enes Subas",
        "email": "19182329+enessubass@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-11-24T13:55:04Z"
